# The race's effects on their own (spec M5): mines.scenario's keys with the test game armed
# with three mines (--save 0:FILE, the player's mines at 3): a mine dropped, a second press
# inside its wait, the car backed over it through the blast, another mine, then Up with the
# horn. Run with --sound, --no-ai, --watch and --cfg FILE, a dr.cfg whose music volume is 0,
# so that the effects are heard without the track's music; recorded to the race's 60th s.
at 2000 key space
at 24500 key Return
at 25600 key Down
at 26500 key Return
at 27600 key Return
at 28800 key space
at 30600 key Return
at 34150 key Return
at 36850 key Return
at 39300 key space
at 51400 keydown Alt_L
at 51500 keyup Alt_L
at 51600 keydown Alt_L
at 51700 keyup Alt_L
at 52200 keydown Down
at 52900 keyup Down
at 53600 keydown Alt_L
at 53700 keyup Alt_L
at 53800 keydown Up
at 54000 keydown space
at 54600 keyup space
at 54700 keyup Up
at 60000 shot end
